{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaReyBgyvQLYKi6LRaki","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I replaced the `sorry` in `plus_eq_add` with an induction on `m`, and `lean Main.lean` now exits 0 with no errors or warnings.\n\n```lean\ntheorem plus_eq_add (n m : Nat) : plus n m = n + m := by\n  induction m with\n  | zero => rfl\n  | succ m ih => rw [plus, ih]; rfl\n```\n\n- **Base case (`m = 0`):** `plus n 0` reduces to `n` by the first equation, and `n + 0` is `n` by definition, so `rfl` closes it.\n- **Step case (`m + 1`):** `rw [plus, ih]` rewrites `plus n (m + 1)` to `plus n m + 1`, then to `n + m + 1`. That equals `n + (m + 1)` by definitional unfolding of `Nat.add`, so `rfl` closes it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":820,"cache_read_input_tokens":8657,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":820},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c9c3b59-8c53-4ff5-ac06-c04d01b83fdc","uuid":"e3090c4f-c0f5-4104-a3e5-e18e4ef5b364","timestamp":"2026-10-31T13:52:49.523Z","request_id":"req_011CgaRexvJiKFp76SFhKEFZ"}
